\frac{\partial y_R}{\partial w_i}
= \underbrace{\left(1+\sum_{k=i+1}^{L} w_k+\sum_{i+1\le k<j\le L} w_k w_j+\cdots+\prod_{k=i+1}^{L} w_k\right)}_{\text{backward term}}
